Simple solution using [babel-plugin-module-resolver](https://github.com/tleunen/babel-plugin-module-resolver):

```shell
$ yarn add --dev babel-plugin-module-resolver
```

Then create (or modify) a `.babelrc` (for total newcomers: in your root folder, where your `package.json` is):

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    [
      "module-resolver",
      {
        "root": ["./src"],
        "alias": {
          "@components": "./src/components",
          "@features": "./src/features"
        }
      }
    ]
  ]
}
```

The "simple" setup by @chiefGui worked for me:

**parcel-bundler:** `^1.12.4`

**.babelrc**

```js
{
    "plugins": [
        [
            "module-resolver",
            {
                "root": [
                    "./src"
                ],
                "alias": {
                    "~": "./src"
                }
            }
        ]
    ]
}
```

**tsconfig.json**

```js
{
    // .......

    "compilerOptions": {
        // .......

        "baseUrl": "./",
        "paths": {
            "~/*": [
                "src/*"
            ]
        }
    }
}
```

